        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. V. Prakash Kumar, Ashrita Shetty, Vetrimaaran, Manimaran\n- Films: Udhayam NH4, Veyyil\n- Companies: S Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar's first film was S Pictures' \"Veyyil\" in 2006.\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar became popular in Tamil cinema by the early 2010s.\n- For the film \"Udhayam NH4,\" G. V. Prakash Kumar composed the soundtrack and background score.\n- Film directors Vetrimaaran and Manimaran approached Ashrita Shetty to play the lead role in their venture \"Udhayam NH4.\"",
